{"id": "18028", "title": "龙啸天下", "author": "羽", "category": "玄幻魔法", "count": 85, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/18/18028.htm", "intro": "天地广袤。万物萌发。\r\n　　混沌初起，天生九龙，一龙触规，化地为蛇，遂化成山。吸日月之精华，收人间之灵气，渐复龙形。一日，一风水之师，寻地脉，选龙穴，用玄门之术点中此龙爪，遂使生成，欲求飞升。后遭破坏，灵异突发：它欲觅人间一真龙之身合二为一。灵气升腾，异性萌动，变琥珀，嵌人身；将凡体羽化，使肉身变异，以新生形象再现拓拔氏。将北魏天下搅个沸沸扬扬。。。。。\r\n　　风云突变，啸声四起！\r\n　　人焉？龙焉？谁主沉浮", "base": "files/article/html/18/18028", "chapters": [{"title": "作品相关", "volume": true}, {"title": "我的想法", "file": "1326722.html", "available": false}, {"title": "北魏平城（今山西大同）简介", "file": "1326724.html", "available": false}, {"title": "云冈石窟精美图片", "file": "1326726.html", "available": false}, {"title": "走进云冈", "file": "1326729.html", "available": false}, {"title": "大同的文物精品", "file": "1326732.html", "available": false}, {"title": "古城大同", "file": "1326734.html", "available": false}, {"title": "大同县区风景", "file": "1326736.html", "available": false}, {"title": "北岳恒山", "file": "1326739.html", "available": false}, {"title": "北魏之初地形图", "file": "1326743.html", "available": false}, {"title": "至读者朋友书！(请求原谅)本书完", "file": "1326745.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一章 龙之变化", "volume": true}, {"title": "序", "file": "1326748.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一节 密奏", "file": "1326750.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二节 合计", "file": "1326754.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三节 予兆", "file": "1326760.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四节 震动", "file": "1326764.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五节 勘探", "file": "1326767.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六节 原由(修）", "file": "1326770.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七节 论计", "file": "1326772.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八节 破邪", "file": "1326775.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九节 定计", "file": "1326778.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十节 斗法（上）", "file": "1326780.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一节 斗法（下）", "file": "1326783.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章龙形飞升", "volume"